  "content": [
    {
      "text": "strong and mighty man, descendant of Zarahemla, Mosiah 7:3. leads brethren to land of Nephi, Mosiah 7:6. is imprisoned by King Limhi, Mosiah 7:7. is brought before king, Mosiah 7:8. is honored, Mosiah 7:16. addresses people, Mosiah 8:2. reads record of Limhi, Mosiah 8:6. is told of ancient relics and 24 gold plates, Mosiah 8:8–11. tells of Mosiah2, seer who can translate, Mosiah 8:13–17. is suspected of being priest of Noah3, Mosiah 21:23. declines to baptize king, Mosiah 21:33. leads Limhi and people to freedom, Mosiah 22:11.",
